pve-compose (1.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v1.1.1
  * up: grow the rootfs to lxc.json "disk" after cloning from a template
  * apply: resize rootfs, configure bind mount, warn on storage/template changes
  * config: safe disk unit parsing, validated numeric/boolean fields,
    "swap": 0 preserved, features object honoured and order-normalized
  * mount: pick a free mpN slot instead of overwriting mp0
  * lxc: fix wait timeout and re-check CTID right before create

